# TIN TROOP: a lance kills every foe in its path; every third foe brings a
# soldier back; brass tags give soldiers.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat level 0
cheat no_foes
wait 120
cheat pos 100 121
cheat foe mouse 140 130
cheat foe mouse 160 130
cheat foe mouse 180 130
cheat freeze
wait 2
hold RIGHT 2
press B
wait 30
expect kills == 3
expect lives == 20
expect count_foes == 0
cheat put 5 35 12
wait 40
cheat pos 320 121
hold RIGHT 40
expect lives == 25
expect tile_35_12 == 32
